    {
      "id": "blk-part14-4-your-own-game-0002",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "order": 2,
      "source_hash": "4ede29075d63cedc87a25880a9447ba73de960fd4fd770dcba0cfe25891b8694",
      "translation_status": "pending",
      "original": {
        "language": "en",
        "content": "The final programming exercise on this course is creating a small game of your own with pygame. The exercise template contains some images for you to use. Please don't use any other images in your game, or others will not be able to test your game based on the source code alone."
      },
      "translation": {
        "language": "vi",
        "content": ""
      },
      "metadata": {}
    },
    {
      "id": "blk-part14-4-your-own-game-0003",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "order": 3,
      "source_hash": "11cf43ed3b8de9f56302bc58b03282f9b8df3816a7eaf6b143bdbe7c28249ec3",
      "translation_status": "pending",
      "original": {
        "language": "en",
        "content": "The subject of the game is up to you, but it should be about as complicated as the Sokoban example in this part of the material. The game should contain the following features:"
      },
      "translation": {
        "language": "vi",
        "content": ""
      },
      "metadata": {}
    },
    {
      "id": "blk-part14-4-your-own-game-0004",
      "type": "list",
      "order": 4,
      "source_hash": "c034ad7471ce2e5bc30afa0dde2e28fa46f42e9ffb32a437eb26baffd495bf06",
      "translation_status": "pending",
      "original": {
        "language": "en",
        "content": "* The game has a sprite the player can move in some way\n* The game has some collectable items and/or enemies \n* The player needs to be set a clear task in the game\n* The game contains a counter which tells the player how they are doing in the game\n* The source code for the game is divided into functions like in the Sokoban example"
      },
      "translation": {
        "language": "vi",
        "content": ""
      },
      "metadata": {}
    },
    {
      "id": "blk-part14-4-your-own-game-0005",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "order": 5,
      "source_hash": "1421d9e614869425e6b46269ed17b0f88b33def6e590c4d3d450a6615a640047",
      "translation_status": "pending",
      "original": {
        "language": "en",
        "content": "When the game is finished, submit it for peer reviews with the following form. After this, familiarize yourself with the games of two of your coursemates, give the games a grade you deem appropriate, and write a short review of the game. Please take into account both how interesting and playable the game was, and how readable the program code is, when grading and reviewing the games."
      },
      "translation": {
        "language": "vi",
        "content": ""
      },
      "metadata": {}
    },
    {
