    {
      "id": "blk-part14-4-your-own-game-0026",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "order": 26,
      "source_hash": "dae49fddcf0ada5dc9515f59aa168bc61a15ee7a2871a6ef7b598dd337356566",
      "translation_status": "pending",
      "original": {
        "language": "en",
        "content": "You should assess the game based on the following criteria:"
      },
      "translation": {
        "language": "vi",
        "content": ""
      },
      "metadata": {}
    },
    {
      "id": "blk-part14-4-your-own-game-0027",
      "type": "list",
      "order": 27,
      "source_hash": "267180e01c5966c248ace09940ce98d41d2b65142469d5d11cec0e7c02b7350a",
      "translation_status": "pending",
      "original": {
        "language": "en",
        "content": "* What does the game look like?\n* Is the game *playable*? Is it fun to play and easy to use?\n* Is the game idea interesting?\n* How well is it programmed? Is the code readable, and does it make appropriate use of classes and functions?"
      },
      "translation": {
        "language": "vi",
        "content": ""
      },
      "metadata": {}
    },
    {
      "id": "blk-part14-4-your-own-game-0028",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "order": 28,
      "source_hash": "3a86674827433e22d14b7406bb527e7719d6419a66fd60b072e78be4e5ea232e",
      "translation_status": "pending",
      "original": {
        "language": "en",
        "content": "A good review usually points out both good features and some suggestions for improvements."
      },
      "translation": {
        "language": "vi",
        "content": ""
      },
      "metadata": {}
